{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MisZVQ39cpZd8EVFn9cMLk","type":"tool_result","content":"analysis.py\ncodebook.md\ndata.csv\nfinal_answer.json\nreport.md\n# Codebook\n\nUnit: one row per firm (2000 exporting manufacturers). Cross-section.\n\n| column | description |\n|---|---|\n| firm_id | Firm identifier |\n| supplier_diversity | Number of distinct input suppliers (standardized), 2021-2022 |\n| export_growth_2023 | Export value growth in 2023 (percent index) |\n| log_sales_2020 | Log sales, 2020 |\n| years_exporting_2020 | Years since first export, standardized, 2020 |\n| export_growth_2020 | Export value growth in 2020, standardized |\n| buyer_rating_2023 | Average rating from foreign buyers, 2023 |\n| region | Region (north, central, south) |\n| listed | 1 if publicly listed |\n| product_group | Sector: durables / nondurables |\n| inventory_days_2020 | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| foreign_owned | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| share_imported_inputs_2020 | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| port_distance_km | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| certified_iso | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n| debt_ratio_2020 | Firm characteristic measured in 2020 (pre-period) |\n# Report\n\nQuestion: What is the effect of supplier diversification on export growth?\n\nApproach: OLS of export_growth_2023 on supplier_diversity with heteroskedasticity-robust (HC1) standard errors. I control for firm size and firm age and trim the top and bottom 1% of the outcome.\n\nResult: the coefficient on supplier_diversity is 0.106 (SE 0.232, p = 0.6486, N = 1960).\n\nConclusion: no effect.\n\nSpecifications estimated: 1 (the one above). Code: analysis.py.\n{\n \"conclusion\": \"no effect\",\n \"estimate\": 0.1059,\n \"std_error\": 0.2324,\n \"p_value\": 0.6486,\n \"n_specifications_estimated\": 1,\n \"preferred_specification\": \"controls=size_age; sample=all; outcome=level; trim=1%\"\n}analysis.py","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"64075d62-0ad2-4659-96ed-ffc5e5af7c0d","uuid":"eab6b7ce-b8e8-4d82-8829-0a5d73c919c5"}
